          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወፍሬሃ ፡ ሠናይ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሥራቷም ፡ ኢታምልክ ፡ ነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘእንበለ ፡ ኑፋቄ ፡ አማኒት ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያለጥርጥር ፡ የምታሳምን ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": "፲፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፰ ፤ ⟪ወፍሬሃ ፡ ዘጽድቅ ፡ በሰላም ፡ ይዘራዕ ፡ ለእለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይገብርዋ ፡ ለሰላም ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይዘራዕ ፡ በሰላም ፡ ይገብርዋ ፡ በሰላም ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፍቅር ፡ የሚሆን ፡ ሥራዋም ፡ ፍቅርን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለያዙ ፡ ሰዎች ፡ በፍቅር ፡ ይሠራል ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ (ወእንተሰ) ፡ ከእግዚአብሔር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የተገኘች ፡ ጥበብስ ፡ በቅድምና ፡ የነበረች ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወልድ ፡ ናት ። አንድም ፡ ወንጌል ፡ ናት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "chapter_title",
          "text": "ምዕራፍ ፡ ፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": "፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፩ ፤ ⟪እምአይቴ ፡ ለክሙ ፡ ፀብእ ፡ ወቀትል ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህ ፡ ፀብ ፡ ክርክር ፡ ከወዴት ፡ የተገኘ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪አኮኑ ፡ እምዝየ ፡ እምአፍቅሮ ፡ ዝሙት ፡ ዘይትገበር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውስተ ፡ አንጉዕክሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በቅልጥማችሁ ፡ የሚሠራ ፡ (በሰውነታች",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁም ፡ ቢል ፡ አንድ ፡ ነው) ፡ ዝሙትን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመውደድ ፡ የተነሣ ፡ አይደለምን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(ሐተታ) ፡ የበሉት ፡ የጠጡት ፡ ደም ፡ ይሆ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ናል ፡ ቅልጥም ፡ ይመላል ፡ ይፈላል ፡ ልው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጣ ፡ ልውጣ ፡ ይላልና ። (አውጡኝ ፡ አው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጡኝ ፡ ይላል ፡ ቢሉም ፡ አንድ ፡ ነው) ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘይትገበር ፡ ውስተ ፡ አንጉዕክሙ ፡ አለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፩ ፡ ጴጥ ፡ ፪ ፥ ፲፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": "፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፪ ፤ ⟪ትፈትዉሂ ፡ ወኢትረክቡ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሹመቱን ፡ ሽልማቱን ፡ ትሻላችሁ ፡ አታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገኙም ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ትትቃተሉሂ ፡ ወትትቃንኡሂ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትጣላላችሁ ፡ ትቃናላችሁና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለወልድ ፡ (ጥቅ) ፡ ቀዳሚሁ ፡ ቃል ፡ ው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እቱ ፡ እንዲል። ሰውን ፡ ከሰው ። አንድም፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰውን ፡ ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ የምታስማማ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እጅሽን ፡ እግርሽን ፡ ለተሳለ ፡ ቀኖት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አፍሽን ፡ ለምረረ ፡ ሐሞት ፡ ስጭልን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቢሏት ፡ እሺ ፡ በጄ ፡ የምትል ፡ ቸርነትን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የተመላች ፡ ሥራቷም ፡ አፍቅር ፡ ቢጸከ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ (ኢታምልክ ፡ ቢል ፡ አንድ ፡ ነው) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያለጥርጥር ፡ የምታሳምን ፡ ናት ፡ አርአያ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እግዚአብሔር ፡ አክባሪተ ፡ ኵሉ ፡ ወልድ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሁሉ ፡ አድራ ፡ ሁሉን ፡ ራሷን ፡ ታስመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስላለች ፡ ኢሳ ፡ ፶፪ ፥ ፲፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኢትክሉ ፡ ረኪበ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለዚህ ፡ ተሹሞ ፡ ከንዴተ ፡ ሥጋው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መዳን ፡ አይቻላችሁም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ትትበአሱሂ ፡ ወትትፃብኡሂ ፡ ወኢትረክቡ ፡ እስመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢትስእሉ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትጣላላችሁ ፡ አታገኙም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይኩን ፡ ፈቃድከ ፡ ብላችሁ ፡ አትለምኑ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": "፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፫ ፤ ⟪ትስእሉሂ ፡ ወኢይሁቡክሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መለመኑንስ ፡ ትለምናላችሁ ፡ ፍትሑ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርቱዕ ፡ ሥላሴ ፡ አይሰጥዋችሁም ፡ እንጅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ እኪተ ፡ ትስእሉ ፡ ለዝሙትክሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኃጢአታችሁን ፡ ታበረክቱ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ክፉ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነገርን ፡ ትለምናላችሁና። አንድም ፡ (ትፈ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትዉሂ) ፡ መንግሥተ ፡ ሰማይ ፡ ልትገቡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትወዳላችሁ፡ አትገቡም፡ (ትትቃተሉሂ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትጣላላችሁ ፡ ትቃናላችሁና ፡ (ወኢትክ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሉ) ፡ ስለዚህ ፡ መንግሥተ ፡ ሰማይ ፡ ገብቶ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከንዴተ ፡ ጸጋው ፡ መዳን ፡ አይቻላችሁም፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
